<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Us vs Them</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Nemzzz</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Us vs Them</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0lmypbWmfuFdxVhq9N95hv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.300" end="00:06.870">Aye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.870" end="00:09.570">Fuck that girl you're chasing, that's a waste of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.570" end="00:12.680">Yo, fuck that, tired of waiting, just do him on sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.680" end="00:15.570">Too much ties, so much ties, I can get you slimed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.570" end="00:19.140">Balenciaga head to toe but I'm not a fashion guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.140" end="00:22.200">So much Chrome on me, the top came oversized</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.200" end="00:25.040">So much Chrome on me, the top came oversized</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.040" end="00:27.810">Are you for me? Me, I don't know, I had to let them go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.810" end="00:30.830">Try hide that hate from me but that envy still gonna show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.830" end="00:34.240">I can vouch bro been in the T, he had fiends lined up on the road</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.240" end="00:37.050">Found me a sweet one, before that, it was bros over hoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.050" end="00:40.250">Didn't sleep till I got man down and turned man's day right upside down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.250" end="00:43.120">I thought he'd sing like James but fed thought that I was serving brown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.120" end="00:46.570">I don't want no love, a matter of time until they give me the crown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.570" end="00:49.980">And by then, I'll be gone, I'll be out of town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.980" end="00:52.670">Fuck that girl you're chasing, that's a waste of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.670" end="00:55.790">Yo, fuck that, tired of waiting, just do him on sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.790" end="00:58.680">Too much ties, so much ties, I can get you slimed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.680" end="01:02.250">Balenciaga head to toe but I'm not a fashion guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.250" end="01:05.380">So much Chrome on me, the top came oversized</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.380" end="01:08.050">So much Chrome on me, the top came oversized</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.050" end="01:09.550">This here gonna hurt feelings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.220" end="01:10.720">A and E way more than a beating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.720" end="01:12.280">Heart gone cold like where is the heating?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.280" end="01:13.870">Bando setting's a business meeting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.870" end="01:15.370">Hungry still best know I been eating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.340" end="01:17.070">They gotta pay me just for the greeting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.070" end="01:18.960">It got dark from early, like winter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.960" end="01:20.540">These days, keep it in a circle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.540" end="01:22.110">'Cah man just way too inner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.110" end="01:25.760">She ask me about the sign I throw up, I told her, "Bae, we winners"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.760" end="01:27.260">Aye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.920" end="01:29.670">Fuck that girl you're chasing, that's a waste of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.670" end="01:32.640">Yo, fuck that, tired of waiting, just do him on sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.640" end="01:35.680">Too much ties, so much ties, I can get you slimed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.680" end="01:39.110">Balenciaga head to toe but I'm not a fashion guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.110" end="01:42.250">So much Chrome on me, the top came oversized</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.250" end="01:50.250">So much Chrome on me, the top came oversized</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.730" end="01:52.420" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(ZEL, this shit crazy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.420" end="01:56.420" /></div></body></tt>